{%- comment -%}
  Founding-customer block + trust badges for the product page.

  Replaced the old "launch sale" countdown on 2026-07-27. The offer is a founding
  cohort with a hard cap, NOT a time-limited sale, so a ticking clock contradicts it.
  (That clock also reset itself from localStorage on every visit, which is not honest.)

  The remaining-slots number reads the shop metafield `meowbelle.founding_remaining`
  (integer), so Z can update it in the Shopify admin without touching code. If the
  metafield is unset it falls back to copy with no number in it, so nothing on the
  page ever claims a count we cannot stand behind.

  Offer definition lives in PRICING.md.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign founding_total = 500 -%}
{%- assign founding_left = shop.metafields.meowbelle.founding_remaining.value -%}

<div class="mb-founding">
  <div class="mb-founding__head">
    <span class="mb-founding__ic">🐾</span>
    <b>Founding customer price</b>
  </div>
  {%- if founding_left and founding_left > 0 -%}
    {%- assign taken = founding_total | minus: founding_left -%}
    {%- assign pct = taken | times: 100 | divided_by: founding_total -%}
    <p class="mb-founding__sub">
      Only <b>{{ founding_left }}</b> of the first {{ founding_total }} places left.
    </p>
    <div class="mb-founding__bar"><i style="width:{{ pct }}%"></i></div>
  {%- else -%}
    <p class="mb-founding__sub">
      Locked in for the first {{ founding_total }} cat parents. Not a sale, and it won't come back.
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

<div class="mb-trust">
  <div><span class="t-ic">🚚</span> Free delivery on 2 bags or more</div>
  <div><span class="t-ic">📍</span> Dhaka city only · ৳70 flat delivery</div>
  <div><span class="t-ic">🛵</span> Large bags (8 kg &amp; 15 kg) delivered by our own team inside Dhaka, ৳150, 2 working days</div>
  <div><span class="t-ic">↩️</span> 30-day happy-cat guarantee</div>
  <div><span class="t-ic">🩺</span> Vet-formulated recipe</div>
  <div><span class="t-ic">🔒</span> bKash · Nagad · Card · COD</div>
</div>
